<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bioc="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn/biocolor/1.0" xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_fluxbank-external-transfer-detail" targetNamespace="https://fluxbank.local/architecture" exporter="FluxBank architecture documentation" exporterVersion="2">
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_app" name="FluxBank | external transfer" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:laneSet id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_app_lanes">
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_app_reserve" name="Reserve">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_app_provider" name="Provider call">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_app_final" name="Finalize">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask23</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_app_return" name="Result">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask25</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess1" name="TX-RESERVATION | createPendingAndReserve()">
      <bpmn:documentation>Spring proxy starts this database transaction on entry. Successful return/flush commits all enclosed writes. RuntimeException or commit failure rolls back the enclosed writes. JPA SQL may be issued at flush; the diagram shows Java execution order. REQUIRED joins a caller transaction; the normal HTTP orchestration has no outer transaction.
Sources: ExternalTransferReservationService.createPendingAndReserve() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/ExternalTransferReservationService.java:36</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask2" name="01 | Lock + validate source&#10;AccountBalanceRepository&#10;.findByAccountPublicIdForUpdate()">
        <bpmn:documentation>Sources: AccountBalanceRepository.findByAccountPublicIdForUpdate() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/repository/AccountBalanceRepository.java:39; Account.validateAvailableForDebit() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/domain/Account.java:204</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow5</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask3" name="02 | Reserve 100 EUR&#10;AccountBalance.reserve(100)&#10;Current 1000 / reserved 100">
        <bpmn:documentation>Available 1000→900; current unchanged. Insufficient available throws; no provider call on rollback.
Sources: AccountBalance.reserve() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/domain/AccountBalance.java:113</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow5</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow6</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask4" name="03 | INSERT PENDING + COMMIT&#10;Transfer.create() → save()&#10;EXTERNAL; destination = null">
        <bpmn:documentation>Generate TRX reference; save TransferRepository.save(). Reservation and INSERT commit atomically. Return ReservedExternalTransfer.
Sources: TransferReferenceGenerator.nextReference() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/TransferReferenceGenerator.java:18; Transfer.create() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/domain/Transfer.java:157; ExternalTransferReservationService.createPendingAndReserve() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/ExternalTransferReservationService.java:36</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow6</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow5" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask2" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask3" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow6" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask3" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask4" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask7" name="04 | Send payment after commit&#10;ExternalTransferProcessor.process()&#10;MockBankPaymentProviderClient&#10;.sendPayment()">
      <bpmn:documentation>PaymentProviderRequest → BankTransferRequest. HTTP POST /idempotent-transfers outside any financial DB transaction. idempotency_key=reference; from/to are configured provider accounts, not beneficiary IBAN.
Sources: ExternalTransferProcessor.process() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/provider/ExternalTransferProcessor.java:20; MockBankPaymentProviderClient.sendPayment() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/infrastructure/MockBankPaymentProviderClient.java:36</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask8" name="05 | Classify provider response&#10;PaymentProviderResult.status()&#10;SUCCESS / REJECTED / UNKNOWN">
      <bpmn:documentation>SUCCESS: non-null response with top-level status completed. HTTP 4xx→REJECTED. 5xx/network/timeout/decoding/null/non-completed body→UNKNOWN. No configured explicit timeout or retry.
Sources: MockBankPaymentProviderClient.sendPayment() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/infrastructure/MockBankPaymentProviderClient.java:36</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway9" name="Provider outcome?">
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow10" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess1" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask7" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow11" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask7" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask8" name="Map provider result" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow12" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask8" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway9" />
    <bpmn:subProcess id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess13" name="TX-FINANCIAL | complete()">
      <bpmn:documentation>Spring proxy starts this database transaction on entry. Successful return/flush commits all enclosed writes. RuntimeException or commit failure rolls back the enclosed writes. JPA SQL may be issued at flush; the diagram shows Java execution order. REQUIRED joins a caller transaction; the normal HTTP orchestration has no outer transaction.
Sources: ExternalTransferFinalizationService.complete() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/ExternalTransferFinalizationService.java:35</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask14" name="06a | Lock Transfer + balance&#10;Validate EXTERNAL / PENDING">
        <bpmn:documentation>Lock Transfer first, then source balance. Terminal status rejects repeated settlement.
Sources: TransferRepository.findByPublicIdForUpdate() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/repository/TransferRepository.java:26; ExternalTransferFinalizationService.validateExternalPending() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/ExternalTransferFinalizationService.java:73; AccountBalanceRepository.findByAccountPublicIdForUpdate() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/repository/AccountBalanceRepository.java:39</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask15" name="07a | Settle + complete + Outbox&#10;AccountBalance.settle(100)&#10;Current 900 / reserved 0">
        <bpmn:documentation>Available stays 900. UPDATE balance + Transfer COMPLETED + INSERT Outbox commit together. Provider payment cannot be rolled back by this local TX.
Sources: AccountBalance.settle() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/domain/AccountBalance.java:137; Transfer.complete() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/domain/Transfer.java:207; OutboxTransferEventPublisher.publishCompleted() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/infrastructure/OutboxTransferEventPublisher.java:32</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow16" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask14" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask15" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess17" name="TX-REJECTION | fail()">
      <bpmn:documentation>Spring proxy starts this database transaction on entry. Successful return/flush commits all enclosed writes. RuntimeException or commit failure rolls back the enclosed writes. JPA SQL may be issued at flush; the diagram shows Java execution order. REQUIRED joins a caller transaction; the normal HTTP orchestration has no outer transaction.
Sources: ExternalTransferFinalizationService.fail() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/ExternalTransferFinalizationService.java:57</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask18" name="06b | Lock Transfer + balance&#10;Validate EXTERNAL / PENDING">
        <bpmn:documentation>Sources: TransferRepository.findByPublicIdForUpdate() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/repository/TransferRepository.java:26; ExternalTransferFinalizationService.validateExternalPending() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/ExternalTransferFinalizationService.java:73; AccountBalanceRepository.findByAccountPublicIdForUpdate() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/repository/AccountBalanceRepository.java:39</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask19" name="07b | Release + mark FAILED&#10;AccountBalance.release(100)&#10;Current 1000 / reserved 0">
        <bpmn:documentation>Available 900→1000. Transfer.fail(EXTERNAL_PROVIDER_REJECTED). Both UPDATEs commit together. No completion Outbox and no History.
Sources: AccountBalance.release() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/domain/AccountBalance.java:125; Transfer.fail() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/domain/Transfer.java:219</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow20" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask18" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask19" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow21" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway9" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess13" name="SUCCESS" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow22" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway9" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess17" name="REJECTED" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask23" name="UNKNOWN: keep reservation&#10;PENDING; current 1000 / reserved 100&#10;No reconciliation implemented">
      <bpmn:documentation>Available remains 900; no Outbox or History. Provider-success/local-commit-failure is also unresolved. Outbox recovery is unrelated.
Sources: ExternalTransferProcessor.process() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/provider/ExternalTransferProcessor.java:20</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow24" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway9" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask23" name="UNKNOWN / timeout" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask25" name="08 | Return current state&#10;TransferLifecycleService.getResponse()&#10;HTTP 201: COMPLETED / FAILED / PENDING">
      <bpmn:documentation>Finalization rollback retains earlier reservation and PENDING; exception propagates instead of this normal response. Completed events continue through Outbox to source-only DEBIT History.
Sources: TransferLifecycleService.getResponse() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/TransferLifecycleService.java:79</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow26" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess13" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask25" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow27" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_subProcess17" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask25" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Flow28" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask23" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask25" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_bank" name="MockBank | separate system and database" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:receiveTask id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_receiveTask29" name="POST /idempotent-transfers&#10;Reference-based idempotency&#10;Configured settlement → recipient">
      <bpmn:documentation>docker/mockbank/src/routes/transfer_routes.py:create_idempotent_transfer_endpoint(). First success response is flat; duplicate response may nest transaction and be UNKNOWN to the FluxBank adapter. Provider reference is not persisted.</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:receiveTask>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_fluxbank-external-transfer-detail">
    <bpmn:documentation>04 | EXTERNAL: A → external bank, 100 EUR
Source: current working tree, 2026-11-08. Documentation only; isExecutable=false. Solid arrows = local execution order. Dashed arrows = HTTP/Kafka messages across pools. Green expanded subprocess = Spring database transaction, not BPMN compensation semantics. Red = failure; amber = retry/recovery. DB visibility is by commit and SELECT, not an in-memory message. Open README.md for the source index and linked pages.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_app_pool" name="FluxBank | external transfer" processRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_app" />
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_bank_pool" name="MockBank | separate system and database" processRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_bank" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Message30" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask7" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_receiveTask29" name="HTTP request (no DB TX)" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_Message31" sourceRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_receiveTask29" targetRef="fluxbank-external-transfer-detail_serviceTask8" name="HTTP response" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
